# What comes from the USB stick's home folder to an installed Bombadil, one path per line,
# relative to the home folder. Anything that is not here stays on the stick. A thread that
# makes something worth keeping adds a line; the installer needs no change.
#
# The sign-in and the chosen AI, so the installed system starts signed in.
.claude
.claude.json
.codex
.config/bombadil
# The desk's places, and what Tips has taught (the days of use, the tips tried), so the first week does not begin
# again on the disk. The log of turns and the conversation stay with the live session.
.local/state/bombadil/desk.toml
.local/state/bombadil/tips.json
# The apps made on the stick.
Apps
# The browser's own profile.
.config/chromium
